cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use lenseff in your research, please cite it as below.
title: "lenseff: detection efficiency for planetary microlensing surveys"
abstract: >-
  lenseff computes detection efficiency for planetary microlensing surveys by
  injection-recovery. It injects binary-lens perturbations into single-lens
  light curves on a survey's real observing calendar, scores them against a
  freely refitted point-source point-lens model, and aggregates the recoveries
  into an efficiency surface in the (log q, log s) plane with binomial
  confidence intervals.
type: software
